## PR-H2 — Checkout Input Validation

### Scope
Harden DTO with Iraqi phone validation, max lengths, and HTML/script rejection.

### Proposed Changes

#### [MODIFY] [checkout.dto.ts](file:///e:/Project/DilMart-Store/backend/src/modules/checkout/checkout.dto.ts)
- Add `@Matches(/^(07\d{9}|\+9647\d{9})$/)` on `customer_phone`
- Add `@MaxLength(100)` on `customer_name`
- Add `@MaxLength(200)` on `area`
- Add `@MaxLength(300)` on `nearest_landmark`
- Add `@MaxLength(1000)` on `notes`
- Add custom `@NoHtmlTags()` validator for text fields

#### [MODIFY] [checkout.service.ts](file:///e:/Project/DilMart-Store/backend/src/modules/checkout/checkout.service.ts)
- Normalize phone in `submit()`: strip `+964` prefix → `0` prefix before passing to RPC
- This ensures Jenni dispatch always receives `07XXXXXXXXX`

### Acceptance Criteria
- `abc` or `123` as phone → 400
- `07501234567` → accepted
- `+964751234567` → accepted and normalized to `0751234567`
- Long notes (>1000 chars) → 400
- `<script>alert(1)</script>` in name → 400
- Existing checkout flow still works
- Price calculation and RPC unchanged

