## PR-H3 — Safe Admin Search

### Scope
Fix unsafe `.or()` filter construction in admin service.

### Proposed Changes

#### [MODIFY] [admin.service.ts](file:///e:/Project/DilMart-Store/backend/src/modules/admin/admin.service.ts)
- Replace raw `.or()` string interpolation with escaped search:
  - Escape PostgREST special chars: `%`, `,`, `.`, `(`, `)`, `:`
  - Add `@MaxLength(80)` on search DTO
  - Trim + normalize search input
- Apply same fix to all other `.or()` / `.ilike()` calls that take user input

#### [NEW] [search-utils.ts](file:///e:/Project/DilMart-Store/backend/src/common/search-utils.ts)
- Shared `escapePostgrestSearch(input: string): string` utility
- Used by admin.service.ts, orders.service.ts, any other search

### Acceptance Criteria
- Normal name/email/phone search works
- `%`, `,`, `.`, `(`, `)`, `:` in search → safe (no query alteration)
- No 500 errors from malformed search

