## PR-P2 — Analytics Aggregation

### Scope
Replace in-memory analytics with SQL RPC aggregation.

### Proposed Changes

#### [NEW] Migration: `20260608_analytics_rpc.sql`
- Create `analytics_overview` RPC that returns aggregated metrics:
  - Total/today/month revenue + order counts
  - Top products (by quantity sold)
  - Top governorates (by revenue)
  - Status distribution
  - 7-day trend
  - Monthly stats
- Add indexes: `orders(created_at)`, `orders(status)`, `orders(merchant_id)`, `order_items(order_id)`

#### [MODIFY] [admin.service.ts](file:///e:/Project/DilMart-Store/backend/src/modules/admin/admin.service.ts)
- `getAnalyticsOverview()`: call RPC instead of loading all data
- Keep response contract identical for frontend compatibility

### Acceptance Criteria
- No `select("*")` for all orders/items
- Works fast with 10K+ orders
- Dashboard UI unchanged
- Build passes

